{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/js-4-module/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Overblog","author":"zit"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"7bfa4631-2028-5486-8e93-e7178af1614a","html":"<p>随着 JS 能做的事情越来越多，应用程序也越来越复杂，便出现了模块的概念，将 JS 程序分割成不同的块。模块化可以解决命名冲突/污染问题，良好的模块化设计可以降低代码之间的耦合，提高代码的可维护性、可扩展性和可复用性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"es-modules\"><a href=\"#es-modules\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>ES Modules</h2>\n<p>ESM 加载模块的方式取决于所处的环境，Node.js 同步加载，浏览器端异步加载。支持模块静态分析。可以作为外部文件引入，也可以在嵌入式脚本中使用，script 需要有 <code class=\"language-text\">type=&quot;module&quot;</code> 属性，异步加载异步执行。</p>\n<h3 id=\"import\"><a href=\"#import\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>import</h3>\n<p>  特性</p>\n<ol>\n<li>引入只读的<strong>实时绑定</strong>的模块。实时绑定指导出的模块改变时，引入的值也会更新。</li>\n<li>引入的模块默认在<strong>严格模式</strong>下运行。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>  语法</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"text\"><pre class=\"language-text\"><code class=\"language-text\">```jsx\n  import defaultExport from &quot;module-name&quot;;\n  import * as name from &quot;module-name&quot;;\n  import { export1 [, export2] } from &quot;module-name&quot;;\n  import { export1 as alias1, export2 } from &quot;module-name&quot;;\n  import defaultExport, { export1 } from &quot;module-name&quot;;\n  import defaultExport, * as name from &quot;module-name&quot;;\n  import &quot;module-name&quot;;\n  var promise = import(&quot;module-name&quot;);\n```</code></pre></div>\n<p>  dynamic import()</p>\n<p>  返回一个 promise。有些情况下适合使用动态引入，但是没必要最好不用。静态引用一般满足使用，而且还可以用于 tree shaking。</p>\n<h3 id=\"export\"><a href=\"#export\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>export</h3>\n<p>  特性</p>\n<ol>\n<li>导出实时绑定的函数、对象、原始值，供其他模块引入。</li>\n<li>导出的模块默认在<strong>严格模式</strong>下运行。</li>\n<li>不可以在嵌入式脚本中使用</li>\n</ol>\n<p>  语法</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Named Exports(一个模块有0个或多个)</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\">  <span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> name1<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> name2<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> …<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> nameN\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> name1 <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> …<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> name2 <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> …<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> …<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> nameN<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">functionName</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token operator\">...</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ClassName</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token operator\">...</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// Export list</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> name1<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> name2<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> …<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> nameN <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// Renaming exports</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> variable1 <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> name1<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> variable2 <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> name2<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> …<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> nameN <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// Exporting destructured assignments with renaming</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> name1<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> name2<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> bar <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> o<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Default Exports(一个模块只有1个)</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\">  <span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> expression<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">…</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> … <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">name1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">…</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> … <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> name1 <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> … <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// Aggregating modules</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> …<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> name1 <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> …<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> name1<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> name2<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> …<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> nameN <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> …<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> import1 <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> name1<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> import2 <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> name2<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> …<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> nameN <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> …<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> … <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> …<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"commonjs-modules\"><a href=\"#commonjs-modules\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>CommonJS Modules</h2>\n<p>CommonJS 通过同步的方式加载模块，首次加载会缓存结果，后续加载则是直接读取缓存结果。</p>\n<p>  特性</p>\n<ul>\n<li>同步加载</li>\n<li>缓存模块</li>\n</ul>\n<p>  语法</p>\n<ul>\n<li>exports</li>\n<li>modules.exports</li>\n<li>require <a href=\"https://nodejs.org/dist/latest-v16.x/docs/api/modules.html#all-together\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">require(x) 算法</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"相关知识\"><a href=\"#%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>相关知识</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>ES modules 浏览器支持情况？现在编译成了什么样子？Vite？</li>\n<li>模块化与工程化：webpack。webpack 同时支持 CommonJS、AMD 和 ESM 三种模块化规范的打包。根据不同规范 webpack 会将模块处理成不同的产物。看看产物</li>\n</ol>","timeToRead":2,"frontmatter":{"title":"Module","date":"November 22, 2021","spoiler":"JS 第四篇之 Module","cta":"JS"},"fields":{"slug":"/js-4-module/","langKey":"en"}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/js-4-module/","previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/js-3-promise/","langKey":"en","directoryName":"js-3-promise"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Promise"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/js-5-prototype/","langKey":"en","directoryName":"js-5-prototype"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Prototype"}},"translations":[],"translatedLinks":[]}},"staticQueryHashes":["708209134"]}